{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32912","headline":"立秋後自京归家 · 李郢","name":"立秋後自京归家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"篱落秋归见豆花，竹门当水岸横槎。\n松斋一雨宜清簟，佛室孤灯对绦纱。\n尽日抱愁跧似鼠，移时不动嬾於虵。\n西江近有鲈鱼否，张翰扁舟始到家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}